===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An area in which [[land mine]]s have been [[laid]].
# {{lb|en|by extension}} A [[dangerous]] [[situation]].
# {{lb|en|cricket}} A [[pitch]] that has dried out and [[crumble]]d and on which the [[ball]] is [[bouncing]] and [[spinning]] [[unpredictably]].

